OL,3,GNEWSABoxing club given two weeks to
OL,4,Afind new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community boxing club is fighting for
OL,7,Fits future after being given two weeks
OL,8,Fto find a new home.
OL,10,FWest Oxon Boxing and Fitness Club,
OL,11,Fbased at Crawley Mill near Witney, has
OL,12,Fbeen told to vacate the premises after
OL,13,Fthe building's owner raised concerns
OL,14,Fabout the safety of its flooring.
OL,16,FThe charity, which has used the
OL,17,Fbuilding for a decade, is now appealing
OL,18,Ffor public support to help fund its
OL,19,Fmove.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
