OL,3,GNEWSABoxing club given two weeks to
OL,4,Afind new home
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There's nowhere for us to go at the
OL,7,Fmoment, we're just devastated," said
OL,8,FSharon Turner, who owns the club. "But
OL,9,Fwe will do everything in our power to
OL,10,Ffind a new building."
